<title>GREECE: Greek 1M ATHIBOR falls to 13.25 from 13.38pct.</title>
<headline>Greek 1M ATHIBOR falls to 13.25 from 13.38pct.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered Rate (Athibor) for one month fell to 13.25 percent from 13.38 percent on Tuesday and the bid rate (Athibid) decreased to 12.75 from 12.88 percent.</p>
